01:08:49.100 --> 01:08:50.300
Hati-hati ya.

01:08:51.766 --> 01:08:52.766
Maika.

01:08:54.100 --> 01:08:55.766
Kamu cantik banget hari ini.

01:08:58.800 --> 01:08:59.800
Aku

01:09:02.800 --> 01:09:03.800
berangkat.

01:09:18.466 --> 01:09:21.366
Sayang, maafkan aku.

